		{"name":"storechessboardstyle","args":[{"kind":"m","placeholder":"name"},{"kind":"m","placeholder":"key=value list"}],"doc":"With the \\storechessboardstyle{〈name〉}{〈key=value list〉} it is possible to store a list of key=value-pairs in a “style” and to use this style instead of the keys themselves."},
